"id":12901,"title":"Job 2:10","segments":["But he said unto her, Thou speakest as one of the foolish women speaketh. What? shall we receive good at the hand of God, and shall we not receive evil? In all this did not Job sin with his lips."],"ref":"Job 2:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"But he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto her, Thou speakest","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" as one","strong":"H259"},{"text":" of the foolish women","strong":"H5036"},{"text":" speaketh","strong":"H1696"},{"text":". What","strong":"H1571"},{"text":"? shall we receive","strong":"H6901"},{"text":" good","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" at the hand of God","strong":"H430"},{"text":", and shall we not receive","strong":"H6901"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":"? In all this did not Job","strong":"H347"},{"text":" sin","strong":"H2398"},{"text":" with his lips","strong":"H8193"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12902,"title":"Job 2:11","segments":["¶Now when Job's three friends heard of all this evil that was come upon him, they came every one from his own place; Eliphaz the Temanite, and Bildad the Shuhite, and Zophar the Naamathite: for they had made an appointment together to come to mourn with him and to comfort him."],"ref":"Job 2:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"¶Now when Job's","strong":"H347"},{"text":" three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" friends","strong":"H7453"},{"text":" heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" of all this evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" that was come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" upon him, they came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" every one","strong":"H376"},{"text":" from his own place","strong":"H4725"},{"text":"; Eliphaz","strong":"H464"},{"text":" the Temanite","strong":"H8489"},{"text":", and Bildad","strong":"H1085"},{"text":" the Shuhite","strong":"H7747"},{"text":", and Zophar","strong":"H6691"},{"text":" the Naamathite","strong":"H5284"},{"text":": for they had made an appointment","strong":"H3259"},{"text":" together","strong":"H3162"},{"text":" to come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to mourn","strong":"H5110"},{"text":" with him and to comfort","strong":"H5162"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":12903,"title":"Job 2:12","segments":["And when they lifted up their eyes afar off, and knew him not, they lifted up their voice, and wept; and they rent every one his mantle, and sprinkled dust upon their heads toward heaven."],"ref":"Job 2:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"And when they lifted up","strong":"H5375"},{"text":" their eyes","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" afar off","strong":"H7350"},{"text":", and knew","strong":"H5234"},{"text":" him not, they lifted up","strong":"H5375"},{"text":" their voice","strong":"H6963"},{"text":", and wept","strong":"H1058"},{"text":"; and they rent","strong":"H7167"},{"text":" every one","strong":"H376"},{"text":" his mantle","strong":"H4598"},{"text":", and sprinkled","strong":"H2236"},{"text":" dust","strong":"H6083"},{"text":" upon their heads","strong":"H7218"},{"text":" toward heaven","strong":"H8064"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":12904,"title":"Job 2:13","segments":["So they sat down with him upon the ground seven days and seven nights, and none spake a word unto him: for they saw that [his] grief was very great."],"ref":"Job 2:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"So they sat down","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" with him upon the ground","strong":"H776"},{"text":" seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" and seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" nights","strong":"H3915"},{"text":", and none spake","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" a word","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" unto him: for they saw","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" that [his] grief","strong":"H3511"},{"text":" was very","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" great","strong":"H1431"},{"text":"."}]}]}
